                <Fragment slot="title">
                  1. How much does a professional business website cost?
                </Fragment>
                <p>
                  The cost of a professional business website depends on the number of pages, design
                  requirements, content, integrations and functionality involved. A straightforward
                  service website generally requires less development work than a more customized
                  website with advanced features. I provide a tailored quotation after reviewing
                  your business goals and project requirements.
