                  and required functionality. A smaller business website may take a few weeks, while
                  larger or more customized projects can take longer. I outline the expected
                  milestones and delivery schedule before development begins.
                </p>
              </Accordion>
              <Accordion class="faq-3 accordion is-closed block flex-block">
                <Fragment slot="title">3. Which platform is best for my business website?</Fragment>
                <p>
                  WordPress is often a strong option for businesses that need flexible content
                  management and room to expand. Wix Studio, Squarespace or Framer may be suitable
                  for other requirements. I recommend a platform based on your business goals,
                  editing preferences, budget and long-term needs rather than choosing one system
